            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-05T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-06T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-04T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-05T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning then tending south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 28 to 33.</text>
